2
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,000
みんなー！
Everyone!

3
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:16,500
みんなおりゅ〜？
Is everyone here?

4
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,300
なのなのら！
Nano-nanora!

5
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,000
お菓子の国のお姫様
The princess of the Candy Kingdom,

6
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:32,800
とびきりプリティな0歳児
a super pretty 0-year-old!

7
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,000
ピアノだって弾けるんだし
I can even play the piano,

8
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:41,000
赤ちゃんじゃないのらよ！
so I'm not a baby, nanorayo!

9
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:45,800
ワガママだって言うけれど
You call me selfish, but...

10
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:49,800
ルーナはお姫様なのらから
Luna is a princess, nanorakara!

11
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:54,200
ルーナイト達も執事も
LuKnights and even the butler...

12
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:58,200
いちいちうるさいのら！
...are being so noisy about everything, nora!

13
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,800
さぁ ルーナイト達！ 準備はできたのら？
Now then, LuKnights! Are you ready, nora?

14
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,200
出陣なのらー！
To battle, nanora!

15
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:10,800
パフェもシュワシュワも 早く用意するのら！
Prepare the parfait and carbonated drinks quickly, nora!

16
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,000
あれもこれも食べたいのら！
I want to eat this and that, nora!

17
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:17,000
おいしいのはひとりじめ
Keeping all the delicious stuff for myself,

18
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:22,000
まずいのや苦いのは ルーナイト達に差し入れ！
and giving the bad and bitter stuff to the LuKnights!

19
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:25,000
チョコレートの噴水も
Chocolate fountains,

20
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:28,000
キャンディの首飾りも
and candy necklaces...

21
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:31,000
素敵なのたくさんあるのら
There are so many wonderful things, nora!

22
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,000
だからルーナのために集めて来てね♡
So please gather them for Luna, okay? ♡

23
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:37,800
絶対絶対絶対絶対約束！
Absolute, absolute, absolute, absolute promise!

24
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,500
なのなのら！
Nano-nanora!

25
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:51,800
まわるまわるまわるまわるーな
Spinning, spinning, spinning, Mawa-Luna!

26
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,200
まわるまわるまわるまわるーなーな
Spinning, spinning, spinning, Mawa-Luna-na!

27
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:58,800
ぐるぐるぐるぐる回ってもっとぐるぐる回って
Spin round and round, spin even more round and round!

28
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,500
ぐるぐるぐるぐる回ってみんなぐるぐる回って
Spin round and round, everyone spin round and round!

29
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:06,000
ぐるぐるぐるぐるそうやってもっとぐるぐる回って
Spin round and round like that, spin even more round and round!

30
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:10,000
ぐるぐるぐるぐる笑ってずっとぐるぐるまわルーナ
Smile round and round, forever round and round, Mawa-Luna!

31
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:21,800
ぐるぐる地球は回り始め幾億年
The Earth has been spinning round and round for hundreds of millions of years...

32
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:27,500
いつまでもこのまま
Forever just like this...

33
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:34,800
回るみんなに幸せを...
Happiness to everyone spinning...

34
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,800
まわり続くまわルーナ
Continuing to spin, Mawa-Luna!

35
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:43,000
ますますます社会がぐるぐるま〜...あれ？
Society goes round and round more and more... Huh?

36
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,000
ぐるぐるぐるぐる回ってもっとぐるぐる回って
Spin round and round, spin even more round and round!

37
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:50,800
ぐるぐるぐるぐる回ってみんなぐるぐる回って
Spin round and round, everyone spin round and round!

38
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:54,500
ぐるぐるぐるぐる笑ってもっとぐるぐる笑って
Smile round and round, smile even more round and round!

39
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:58,000
ぐるぐるぐるぐる踊ってみんなぐるぐる踊って
Dance round and round, everyone dance round and round!

40
00:04:58,200 --> 00:05:02,500
ぐるぐるぐるぐる回ってもっと
Spin round and round, even more...

41
00:05:03,488 --> 00:05:05,188
んなぁ～
Nnaa~

42
00:05:05,388 --> 00:05:07,888
ぐるぐるまわるまわるーな
Spinning round and round Luna

43
00:05:09,588 --> 00:05:13,188
まんなかちてん...
Center point...

44
00:05:16,388 --> 00:05:18,888
いつもおとぎ話のお姫様 (はい)
Always a princess in a fairytale (Yes!)

45
00:05:18,888 --> 00:05:20,888
みんなの輝くお月様 (はい)
Everyone's shining moon (Yes!)

46
00:05:20,888 --> 00:05:22,888
今日はおやすみして
Taking a rest today

47
00:05:22,888 --> 00:05:25,388
重い王冠今はおいといて
Putting off the heavy crown for now

48
00:05:25,388 --> 00:05:28,888
どっちの私もしゅきになってくれますか
Will you love both versions of me?

49
00:05:28,888 --> 00:05:33,388
どっちもほしいからまん中にいたくなる
Because I want both, I want to stay in the middle

50
00:05:33,888 --> 00:05:37,588
スニーカーとシャツに着替えて
Changing into sneakers and a shirt

51
00:05:38,188 --> 00:05:40,388
あるき出したんだ
I started walking

52
00:05:40,388 --> 00:05:43,388
出発のアラームは
The departure alarm...

53
00:05:43,588 --> 00:05:48,388
新しい私鳴らしてあげる
I'll sound it, my new self!

54
00:05:48,588 --> 00:05:52,588
両腕をいっぱいにしても
Even if I fill both my arms

55
00:05:52,588 --> 00:05:56,388
ぎゅっとしたいこの気持ち入らない
This squeeze-tight feeling won't fit

56
00:05:56,388 --> 00:05:59,888
片方なんて選べない
I can't choose just one side

57
00:05:59,888 --> 00:06:04,188
迷ってるならまん中なんだよ
If you're lost, the answer is right in the middle!

58
00:06:04,388 --> 00:06:06,588
まんかいの青春
Full-bloom youth

59
00:06:06,588 --> 00:06:08,788
満腹に摂取
Consuming to full satisfaction

60
00:06:08,788 --> 00:06:11,188
まんてん流星群
Full marks meteor shower

61
00:06:11,188 --> 00:06:13,388
満月 in heaven
Full moon in heaven

62
00:06:13,388 --> 00:06:15,588
まんめん笑顔にして
Put on a full-faced smile

63
00:06:15,588 --> 00:06:17,588
満点すぎる思い出
Full-score memories

64
00:06:17,588 --> 00:06:19,388
まんまるーな Happy day!!
Manmaru Luna Happy day!!

65
00:06:19,388 --> 00:06:23,888
せかいのまんなかでプリンセスを忘れるくらい
Right in the middle of the world, enough to forget being a princess

66
00:06:23,888 --> 00:06:28,388
胸まんたんにきゅんっとしてみたい
I want to fill my chest full with that fluttering feeling

67
00:06:28,388 --> 00:06:32,388
どっちだってホントの私
Whichever side, it's the real me

68
00:06:32,388 --> 00:06:36,588
瞬きしたら君のどまんなか
If you blink, I'll be right in the center of your heart

69
00:06:37,188 --> 00:06:40,888
まん中にかさなるちてん
The point where it overlaps in the middle

70
00:06:40,888 --> 00:06:44,588
まん中心でよくばるちてん
The point of being greedy in the middle

71
00:06:44,588 --> 00:06:49,188
まん中のまんなかちてん
The center of the center point

72
00:06:49,188 --> 00:06:53,188
恋する女の子のいいとこ取りで
Taking the best of both worlds as a girl in love

73
00:06:53,188 --> 00:06:58,588
照れ隠しと素直の今まんなかちてん
Between shy pretense and honesty, right now is the middle point

74
00:07:00,588 --> 00:07:02,588
跪きなさい。
Kneel before me.

75
00:07:03,188 --> 00:07:07,888
汝、この城の扉を叩いた者よ。
You who knocked on the gates of this castle.

76
00:07:08,388 --> 00:07:10,188
誓いなさい。
Swear your oath.

77
00:07:10,388 --> 00:07:14,388
このルーナの盾となり矛となり—
To become Luna's shield and spear—

78
00:07:14,388 --> 00:07:17,588
夜はぐっすり眠れるまで
Until you can sleep soundly at night

79
00:07:17,888 --> 00:07:21,388
ともにあることをー！
To always be with me!

80
00:07:23,388 --> 00:07:26,188
捧げなさい！姫でおあるぞ！
Offer yourself! For I am your Princess!

81
