スコーンだって こぼさず綺麗に食べて すごい！
Eating your scones neatly without spilling a crumb—amazing!

84
00:07:43,188 --> 00:07:45,888
たまに王冠 どっちが前か間違っちゃうの かわいい！
Occasionally wearing your crown backwards—how cute!

85
00:07:45,888 --> 00:07:47,588
通ってよし！なのら！
You may pass, nano-ra!

86
00:07:47,588 --> 00:07:48,888
開城〜！
Open the gates~!

87
00:07:48,888 --> 00:07:52,188
第一条！ 誰よりルーナが好きな人！
Clause 1! Anyone who loves Luna more than anyone else!

88
