第二条！ シルクのお布団持ってきて！
Clause 2! Bring me a silk blanket!

89
00:07:54,388 --> 00:07:56,388
第三条！ 三時のお茶会来れる人！
Clause 3! Anyone who can attend the 3 o'clock tea party!

90
00:07:56,388 --> 00:07:59,388
守れなかったら 即・制・裁！
If you fail to observe these, immediate sanction!

91
00:07:59,888 --> 00:08:01,888
分かってほしいのら…
I want you to understand-nora...

92
00:08:02,188 --> 00:08:05,388
これも、帝王学を学ぶため……
This too is to study the art of emperorship...

93
00:08:05,588 --> 00:08:09,888
愛という名の…… 教育なのら〜！
It's education... in the name of love-nora~!

94
