守護ってルーナイト 想ってくんないと プロムナードボイコットなのなののら！
Protect me, LuKnight! If you don't care for me, I'll boycott our promenade, nano-nano-nora!

95
00:08:16,388 --> 00:08:19,388
手の甲に 忠誠誓うの Chu!
Swear your loyalty with a kiss on the back of my hand, Chu!

96
