永遠の 忠誠この指に Chu!
Seal your eternal loyalty on this finger, Chu!

104
00:08:55,588 --> 00:08:58,388
ガラスの靴 履かせてワルツ！
Slip on the glass slipper and dance a waltz!

105
00:08:58,388 --> 00:09:00,588
守護ってルーナイト かまってくんないと
Protect me, LuKnight! If you don't give me attention

106
